  "summary": "The published gene filter uniquely identifies control rep5 (GSM1201496) as the inferred omission. With rep5 omitted, the DESeq reconstruction reproduces all 107 traceable author effects at their printed precision. With all seven controls, it reproduces two. The registered seven-control analysis agrees in direction on all 107 paired genes, but coverage of the selected reference is 81.06% (107/132), below the 90% concordance requirement. The proposal passed validation. [Published study](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5680758/) · [Table S1](https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.5589022.v1)",
